                    hint_capital:           `Your political capital is nearly spent. Count what each remaining move costs before you fund it.`,
                    hint_root:              `Engagement can rise while execution quietly stalls. Check which of your moves touched what the opposition stands to lose.`,
                    hint_strong:            `Strong position: changeability up, resistance down, board onside. The checkpoint will test whether it holds.`,

